# =========================
# Generated API / local codegen temp
# =========================
# Hand-edited generated trees stay tracked once committed by the project.
# Ignore local scratch / failed codegen dumps:
frontend/src/generated/api/.tmp/
frontend/.openapi-tmp/
*.generated.tmp.*

